==Trivia==
*Since Killer Gross Cat shares a spritesheet with its [[Killer Gross Cat (Rare Cat)|allied counterpart]], it has a sprite for a face with whiskers that is not used by this enemy. More interestingly, the spritesheet has an unused effect that is shaped similarly to Killer Gross Cat's head with two red streaks over its eyes. This effect also goes unused, but its existence implies that Killer Gross Cat may have originally had a different attack animation.

